[32m+[m[32m  low-level hash table floor, early-exit entropy probe, exponential skip ramp,[m
[32m+[m[32m  hoisted prevhash, backward match extension, bulk literal copies, NEON match[m
[32m+[m[32m  and run detection (also in `get_run()`), 2/4-byte pattern broadcast, and[m
[32m+[m[32m  `pshufb`/NEON fast match copying.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Faster fused SHUFFLE+BYTEDELTA**. Add AVX2 implementation, optimize x86-64[m
[32m+[m[32m  SSE2/SSSE3/AVX2 backward paths, accelerate ARM64 NEON backward decoding with[m
[32m+[m[32m  record-parallel prefix sums, add a zero-high-planes fast path, and fix[m
[32m+[m[32m  missing `shuffle_bytedelta_neon_*` symbols on non-Apple ARM64 builds (#883).[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Lower threading and hot-path overhead**. Run worker `tid 0` directly on the[m
[32m+[m[32m  calling thread, spawn `nthreads - 1` workers in the shared thread pool, skip[m
[32m+[m[32m  redundant wakeups, guard the POSIX shared thread pool under `!_WIN32` for[m
[32m+[m[32m  MSVC, reuse thread-local scratch buffers in `schunk_compress_store()`, remove[m
[32m+[m[32m  hot-path `BLOSC_TRACE_INFO` calls in the disposable prefilter loop, and use[m
[32m+[m[32m  `clock_gettime()` on macOS while skipping unused compression timestamps.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **ZFP buffer bounds fix and build option**. Check compressed size against[m
[32m+[m[32m  `output_len` (and reject `output_len <= 0`) before copying in[m
[32m+[m[32m  `zfp_acc_compress`, `zfp_prec_compress`, and `zfp_rate_compress`, fixing a[m
[32m+[m[32m  heap buffer overflow especially visible with 8-bit ZFP bitstream word size[m
[32m+[m[32m  (#887, #888). Add `PREFER_EXTERNAL_ZFP` CMake option for parity with[m
[32m+[m[32m  `PREFER_EXTERNAL_{LZ4,ZLIB,ZSTD}` (#886).[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Portability fixes**. Mark `print_error()` in `include/blosc2.h` as[m
[32m+[m[32m  `static inline` so unoptimized GCC builds of shared libraries/plugins do not[m
[32m+[m[32m  emit spurious undefined `_blosc2_error_string` references (#884). Fall back[m
[32m+[m[32m  to `dup()` + `FD_CLOEXEC` in `frame.c` and `prefetch.c` when[m
[32m+[m[32m  `F_DUPFD_CLOEXEC` is unavailable at compile time or rejected with `EINVAL` at[m
[32m+[m[32m  runtime (#885).[m
