[32m+[m[32mChanges from 3.6.2 to 3.7.0[m
[32m+[m[32m===========================[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Faster shuffle and bitshuffle**. Speed up shuffle and unshuffle for 2-, 4-,[m
[32m+[m[32m  8-, and 16-byte elements on NEON, SSE2, and AVX2. Accelerate bitshuffle and[m
[32m+[m[32m  bitunshuffle with SIMD, including a bitshuffle fast path for constant[m
[32m+[m[32m  byte-plane prefixes. Enable fused SHUFFLE+BYTEDELTA by default and extend[m
[32m+[m[32m  it to SSSE3 and 2-byte groups.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **BloscLZ 2.6.0**. Improve match finding on periodic filtered data, reuse[m
[32m+[m[32m  worker-local hash tables, and enable decoder fast paths on ARM64 and AMD64.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Less worker setup and synchronization**. Reuse compression state for[m
[32m+[m[32m  independent blocks with bundled LZ4, and claim the next block while reserving[m
[32m+[m[32m  compressed output to reduce scheduler lock acquisitions.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Full-write prefilters**. The new `blosc2_set_prefilter_full_write()` lets a[m
[32m+[m[32m  compression context skip zero-initializing prefilter output when the callback[m
[32m+[m[32m  writes every byte it returns, including padding. Existing prefilters still[m
[32m+[m[32m  receive zeroed output by default. B2ND slice gathering uses the opt-in for[m
[32m+[m[32m  fully overwritten blocks.[m
[32m+[m[32m* **Safer chunk decoding**. Validate the stored size of special-value chunks[m
[32m+[m[32m  against the supplied buffer even when the lazy flag is set (#881). Size[m
[32m+[m[32m  worker scratch buffers for both the block size and element width, and handle[m
[32m+[m[32m  allocation failures so later jobs can retry (#882).[m
