[32m+[m[32m## Billion-element Python constructor and full read[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`blosc2.arange(1e9)`, float64, 12 threads, chunks `(2000000,)`, blocks `(16000,)`,[m
[32m+[m[32mBITSHUFFLE, clevel 1. These match the layout and compressed sizes in the original[m
