[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThree fresh process pairs, 12 measured samples per cell, one billion elements,[m
[32m+[m[32msame fixed partitions and 12 threads. Before is the original `f1256e39` SIMD[m
[32m+[m[32mbaseline, not the intermediate constant-plane experiment.[m
