[32m+[m[32m### Explicit byte-group screen[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mLZ4 level 1, 100M float64 elements, one process pair and three measured samples[m
[32m+[m[32mper cell. This changes filter metadata rather than native code; it is not a[m
[32m+[m[32mbefore/after implementation claim. All sampled values decode correctly.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Fused byte group | arange time | Compressed | linspace time | Compressed |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|[m
[32m+[m[32m| Default (8) | 15.66 ms | 2.65 MB | 20.58 ms | 19.21 MB |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 2 | 23.05 ms | 58.36 MB | 63.14 ms | 800.00 MB |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 4 | 19.00 ms | 18.94 MB | 92.13 ms | 300.12 MB |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 16 (staged fallback) | 19.16 ms | 3.45 MB | 25.78 ms | 27.55 MB |[m
