[32m+[m[32mThe natural float64 group is the best screened choice for both time and size.[m
[32m+[m[32mNo metadata/default change is warranted. Float32 alternatives also fail to[m
[32m+[m[32mestablish a useful time/space win; its default fused path is effectively flat.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSSE2 and AVX2 oracle checks run under Rosetta with ISA-specific object flags.[m
[32m+[m[32mThey do not establish native Intel/AMD performance. AVX-512 is intentionally[m
[32m+[m[32munchanged pending hardware qualification.[m
