[31m-```[m
[31m-offset(0)       offset(1)                 offset(2)             offset(M)[m
[31m-v               v                         v                     v[m
[31m-+---------------+-------------------------+-------------+-------+-------------------+[m
[31m-|    value 0    |         value 1         |   value 2   |  ...  |      value M      |[m
[31m-+---------------+-------------------------+-------------+-------+-------------------+[m
[31m-<--length(0)---><-------length(1)--------><-length(2)-->        <----length(M)----->[m
